{{define "content"}}
<h1 id="heading" tabindex="-1">Recover your account</h1>
<p>Use an already verified recovery email address to register a replacement passkey. Recovery revokes old account sessions and remote enrollments. It does not delete local data or stop local processes.</p>
<p>If this address is eligible for recovery and the message can be delivered, you will receive a code. Otherwise, try again later. The same response is shown for every address.</p>
<noscript><p>Account recovery needs JavaScript and a passkey authenticator.</p></noscript>
<p id="needs-script" class="help">This page needs its script. If this line stays, reload the page or allow scripts for it.</p>
<p id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
<label for="recovery-email">Verified email address</label>
<input type="email" id="recovery-email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="320" required>
<p><button type="button" id="recovery-begin" disabled>Send a recovery code</button></p>
<div id="recovery-proof" hidden>
<label for="recovery-code">Recovery code</label>
<input type="text" id="recovery-code" autocomplete="one-time-code" maxlength="128" required>
<p><button type="button" id="recovery-complete" disabled>Verify code and create a replacement passkey</button></p>
</div>
<p><a href="{{.Base}}/account/sign-in">Back to sign in</a></p>
{{end}}
